\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u9060\u304f\u304b\u3089\u3067\u3082\u659c\u3081\u304b\u3089\u3067\u3082\u306b\u3058\u307f\u307e\u305b\u3093\r\n\u30fb\u5bfe\u5c40\u4e2d\u306e\u753b\u9762\u307e\u308f\u308a\u306e\u30c7\u30b6\u30a4\u30f3\u3092\u4e00\u65b0\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\r\n\u30fb\u724c\u306e\u63cf\u753b\u3092\u4f5c\u308a\u76f4\u3057\u3001\u5f15\u3063\u304b\u304b\u308a\u3092\u6e1b\u3089\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nMahjong has been rebuilt from the ground up.\r\n\r\n[Table and tiles]\r\n- Tiles are engraved ivory now, on a felt-and-timber automatic table\r\n- Tiles actually move: the deal, draws, discards, calls, the winning hand, the dora flip\r\n- New sounds for discards, shuffling and point sticks\r\n\r\n[Reading the hand]\r\n- Your waits and your furiten are always on screen\r\n- Point at a tile and see what you would be waiting on if you cut it\r\n- Every opponent's discards are mirrored onto one upright panel \u2014 no leaning over the table\r\n- Pon, chi, kan, riichi, ron and tsumo are called out, and a win reads its yaku one by one\r\n\r\n[How the table behaves]\r\n- The dice are thrown each hand, and the wall opens where they say\r\n- Point sticks are handed across the table\r\n- Opponents reach out to discard, and every head turns on a riichi or a win\r\n- Red fives, open tanyao and hanchan/east-only are now yours to set\r\n\r\n[Across the app]\r\n- All text has been redrawn: crisp from a distance and at an angle\r\n- The in-game panels have been redesigned\r\n- Tile rendering was rebuilt, so play stutters less", "created_date": 1788277676, "id": "1640014931027111", "version": "1.2", "version_code": 10, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "SUBMITTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "160175